  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 135 ÷ 15 × 54 + 6 - 18 = 252\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) ÷ and +**\n\nGiven: 135 ÷ 15 × 54 + 6 - 18 = 252\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 135 + 15 × __**54 ÷ 6**__ - 18 = 252\n\n⇒ 135 + __**15 × 9**__ - 18 = 252\n\n⇒ __**135 + 135**__ - 18 = 252\n\n⇒ __270 - 18__ = 252\n\n⇒** 252 = 252**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) ÷ and ×\n\nGiven: 135 ÷ 15 × 54 + 6 - 18 = 252\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 135 × __**15 ÷ 54**__ + 6 - 18 = 252\n\n⇒ __**135 × 0.28**__ + 6 - 18 = 252\n\n⇒ __**37.8 + 6**__ - 18 = 252\n\n⇒ __43.8 - 18__ = 252\n\n⇒ 25.8 ≠ 252\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) + and ×\n\nGiven: 135 ÷ 15 × 54 + 6 - 18 = 252\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**135 ÷ 15**__ + 54 × 6 - 18 = 252\n\n⇒ 9 + __**54 × 6**__ - 18 = 252\n\n⇒ __**9 + 324**__ - 18 = 252\n\n⇒ __333____ - 18__ = 252\n\n⇒ 315 ≠ 252\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) + and -\n\nGiven: 135 ÷ 15 × 54 + 6 - 18 = 252\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**135 ÷ 15**__ × 54 - 6 + 18 = 252\n\n⇒ __**9**____** × 54**__ - 6 + 18 = 252\n\n⇒ __**486**__ - 6 __**+ 18**__ = 252\n\n⇒ __**504 - 6**__ = 252\n\n⇒ 498 ≠ 252\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
